msgid ""
"ArduPilot's MAVLink interface for controlling cameras was upgraded for 4.4 "
"compared with earlier versions. This page primarily discusses the interface "
"for 4.4 (and higher) which aims to comply with the `MAVLink Camera protocol "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/camera.html>`__"
