msgstr "CAMERA_INFORMATION、CAMERA_SETTINGS、CAMERA_FOV_STATUS 包含对地面站有用的信息"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:949 388f3efabf0c442e9a1f0d9fda521205
msgid ""
"These three messages include information that can be useful for the ground "
"station."
msgstr "这三条消息包含对地面站有用的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:951 62dc7c4c9a524c2791a4068f385147db
msgid ""
"`CAMERA_INFORMATION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_INFORMATION>`__ includes "
"vendor and model name, firmware version, sensor size, sensor resolution and "
"camera capabilities."
msgstr ""
"`CAMERA_INFORMATION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_INFORMATION>`__ "
"包含厂商及型号名称、固件版本、传感器尺寸、传感器分辨率和摄像头功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:952 bf493ac34e2c4edf8a0129b967226645
msgid ""
"`CAMERA_SETTINGS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_SETTINGS>`__ is much "
"simpler and only includes the mode, zoom level and focus level."
msgstr ""
"`CAMERA_SETTINGS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_SETTINGS>`__ "
"较为简单，仅包含模式、变焦级别和对焦级别。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:953 1d9b8d02117a441db12af6ffab44833c
msgid ""
"`CAMERA_FOV_STATUS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_FOV_STATUS>`__ includes "
"the location (lat, lon, alt) of the camera (or more accurately the vehicle),"
" the location of what the camera gimbal is pointing at and the camera "
"attitude (expressed as a quaternion)."
msgstr ""
"`CAMERA_FOV_STATUS "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_FOV_STATUS>`__ "
"包含摄像头（更准确地说是飞行器）的位置（纬度、经度、高度）、云台指向目标的位置以及摄像头姿态（以四元数表示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:955 00a2355c3d304d2c8eea935c849d9a09
msgid ""
"A ground station can request the messages be sent just once using the "
"`MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE  "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE>`__ "
"command or at regular intervals using `MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL  "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__"
" as described on the :ref:`Requesting Data From The Autopilot <mavlink-"
"requesting-data>` page."
msgstr ""
"地面站可使用 `MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE>`__ "
"命令请求仅发送一次这些消息，或使用 `MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__"
" 按固定间隔发送，详情参见 :ref:`从自动驾驶仪请求数据 <mavlink-requesting-data>` 页面。"

